      "statement": "Program mutations spanning multiple tables are implemented as SECURITY INVOKER Postgres RPCs (not client-side statement sequences) because Supabase-js lacks an interactive multi-statement transaction API; every such RPC includes explicit user_id = auth.uid() predicates as defense-in-depth alongside RLS.",
