      "statement": "save_program(p_tree jsonb) is the unified atomic entry point for insert/upsert/clone/template program writes: it atomically flips program.is_active for all of a user's programs in one UPDATE, then upserts program/program_phase/program_day/program_slot rows with ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE and deletes rows absent from the input tree, preserving row ids across edits so set_log.program_slot_id continuity survives a builder save.",
